Licensing overview
==================

This repository contains two kinds of material under different licenses.

1. Original project contributions: MIT License (below). This covers the
   scripts, configuration files, documentation, sanitized analysis data
   (analysis/), generated figures (assets/figures/) and rendered media
   (assets/demo/) created by the project contributors.

2. Bundled third-party robot model: BSD-3-Clause, NOT relicensed. The
   directory assets/ergocub/ contains the ergoCubSN001 URDF and its meshes,
   copied byte-for-byte from https://github.com/mesh-iit/ergocub-software at
   revision 6c255e258cd184e91765b607222b6b6877bf7459. Copyright (c) 2022,
   iCub Tech. These files remain under their BSD-3-Clause license. The
   complete notice is in assets/ergocub/LICENSE, the attribution and
   adaptation notes are in assets/ergocub/NOTICE, and per-file SHA-256
   digests are in assets/ergocub/provenance.json. The MIT grant below does
   not apply to them.

Rendered media in assets/demo/ and the poster figures depict that ergoCubSN001
model. The project's own simulation and rendering are MIT-licensed; the depicted
robot design remains attributed to iCub Tech under the BSD-3-Clause notice
reproduced at the end of this file.

External dependencies that are not bundled, such as the HumanoidBench DreamerV3
implementation, MuJoCo and the Python packages listed in configs/, are obtained
separately and remain under their own licenses.


